# Now (verified in strict mode):
forall X,Y finite_set,g fn(y Y)X,f fn(x X)R,s R,op fn(a,b R)R:
    forall a,b,c R:
        op(op(a,b),c)=op(a,op(b,c))
    forall a,b R:
        op(a,b)=op(b,a)
    $bijective(Y,X,g)
    =>:
        finite_set_reduce(X,f,op,s)=finite_set_reduce(Y,fn(y Y)R {f(g(y))},op,s)
